<mxCell id="t1" value="postgres:suse-0.1.0 (core)&lt;br&gt;compiled postgres + contrib, verified&lt;br&gt;(cache: cache/suse/core:*)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="60" width="200" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
